2. परी (परि-√ इ) P. पर्य्-एति (Impv. परीहि, MBh.; Pot. प॑रीयाम्, TS.; impf. पर्यैत्, ŚBr.; pf. प॑रीयाय, TS.; fut. पर्य्-एता, ChUp.; ind.p. परीत्य, PārGṛ.; पर्य्-आयं, Br.; inf. प॑र्य्-एतवे, RV.),
to go about, move in a circle;
 (trans.) to go or flow round (acc.), circumambulate, surround, include, grasp, span, RV. &c. &c.;
to run against or into, reach, attain, AV.; ŚBr.; ChUp.;
 (with or sc. मनसा) to perceive, ponder, MBh.; R. :
Intens. Ā. प॑रीयते, to move round or in a circle, RV.
